  - type: framework
    name: Enabling Resilience Investment (ERI) Framework
    description: Value Advisory Partners, with CSIRO, have designed the ground breaking Enabling Resilience Investment (ERI) Framework that is unique within the market and supports efficient and cost-effective planning for, and investment in, disaster resilient built environments and infrastructure. The approach responds to the priorities identified in the National Disaster Risk Reduction Framework and National Action Plan 2. ERI identifies the need to pursue all collaborative financing and funding options for disaster risk reduction initiatives.
